DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T160000
UID:69f8bb7443b41b3d00640481@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Design and build your own colorful keychain using Perler beads
  — from cute animals and emojis to game-inspired icons and custom patter
 ns you invent yourself. Arrange your beads\, watch them fuse together\, an
 d leave with a durable\, one-of-a-kind keychain perfect for backpacks\, lu
 nch bags\, or keys.\nAges 11-14 years\nDrop in\, space is limited\, first 
 come first serve
LOCATION:Humberwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f8bb7443b41b3d00640481
