DESCRIPTION:Find your "inner magic" this P.A. Day with 'The Amazing Magic
  Mel' during this upbeat\, hilarious and interactive magical experience. E
 xpect a healthy dose of participation and self-empowerment as she leads as
 piring magicians of all ages on a journey to become "official magicians" d
 uring this fast-paced\, comedy magic show for the entire family.\nDrop in.
 \nAll ages are welcome.
