 arts & crafts\, and more!\nIn this program\, we'll be mixing chalk and wat
 er to make chalk paint to spice up the front of the library. Program will 
 be outside and subject to the weather. Remember to wear sunscreen!\nDrop-
 in. No registration required. Ages 6-12.\nP.S. We can always provide Perle
 r Beads as secondary activity option if it rains.
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Program Room (downstairs)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f8b80100c14247035ac6bf
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
