  Hot Potato w/ Dash\nMay 12 - Minesweeper inspired game w/ Sphero\nMay 19 
 - Sphero Freeze Tag\nMay 26 - KEVA Planks Tower w/Dash\nJune 2 - Racing w/
  Dash & Sphero\nJune 9 - Pride: Nail Painting & Bracelet Making\nJune 16 -
  Game Day! (Last session)\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club
  for participants.\nFood may contain or have come into contact with common
  allergens. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously supp
 orted\, in part\, by donors.
