DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260727T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260729T160000
UID:69da705b24bd39b0b5e7134d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the library for a 90 min workshop for 3 days! 
 Handle and discuss real and replica fossils of dinosaurs and other extinct
  beasts from all over the world. Discover the wild world of dinosaurs with
  an expert and learn about fossils evolution and the ‘Tree of Life.' Pre
 sented by Dino Bites. Ages 4-12.
LOCATION:Amesbury Park\, program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69da705b24bd39b0b5e7134d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
