UID:69e138c4491b809c6f27d3d1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Pamela Devonshire as she shares her children's book\,\n"W
 here the Lightning Has Struck: A True Story About Mohawk Chief John Desero
 ntyon\,"\nincluding why she wrote her book and why it's important to honou
 r and remember her ancestry. Children will then be invited to create their
  own bookmarks where they can write thank you in Mohawk or the language of
  their choice and share about their own culture and heritage\, too.\nSpace
  is limited.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on 
 this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libr
 aries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only 
