 out of LEGO!\nMay 28: Arts & Crafts:\nJUNIOR SESSION 3:45 - 4:25 PM\nfor c
 hildren ages 4 -6\nSENIOR SESSION 4:30 - 5:15\nfor children ages 7 and up
