DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260507T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260507T170000
UID:694968c6c967cb41207dfe0b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages 6-12.\nDrop-in. No registration required. Limited space ava
 ilable.\nProgram topics will be updated regularly.\nApr 23 - Wind Mobiles\
 nApr 30 - Snap Circuits\nMay 7 - Mother Day Awards\nMay 14 - Secret Codes\
 nMay 21 - Straw Rockets\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club f
 or participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously
  supported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/694968c6c967cb41207dfe0b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
