BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sphero'Mazing!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T190000
UID:69ea8cfecdd2f7e31fe316d7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to code\, race and outsmart the maze!  In this exci
 ting STEM program\, kids\, ages 7 - 12\, will learn the basics of coding 
 while guiding their Sphero robot through twists\, turns and tricky obstacl
 es.  With every challenge\, they'll sharpen their problem-solving skills 
 and discover just how fun technology can be.\nCan your Sphero make it to t
 he finish line?  Let's find out!
LOCATION:Elmbrook Park\, Program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ea8cfecdd2f7e31fe316d7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
