UID:69c4515c5a2d780f42c4bb23@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko leads a hands-on workshop to make the popular Asia
 n beverage\, Brown Sugar Oat Milk with Boba. Participants will learn to pr
 epare and use the classics ingredients including oat milk and tapioca pear
 ls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko will also p
 rovide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally.
