UID:69c7e0f4ad384e40edb7599b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Part 1 of a fun and interactive event where kids c
 an unleash their creativity using TinkerCAD. This hands-on class will intr
 oduce children to the world of 3D design and modeling in a playful and eng
 aging way. No prior experience is needed - just come ready to have a blast
 ! (Don't forget to also register for Part 2 where we paint what we designe
 d in Part 1!)\nFor more information about this program please contact diho
 nline@tpl.ca
